  m_text: "On the DRO select the axis button (X or Y) which corresponds to the edge
    found. While setting the 0,0 of the block you will need to account for the offset
    of the edge finder (0.1\u201D). \n\nDepending on the side of the block make sure
    you are keeping track of (+ or -) values. After you have entered the value select
    ABS set to confirm. "
